---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="section-kicker">the story</p>
      <h2 id="about-title">About</h2>
      <p>
        I grew up in <span lang="es">Bilbao</span> and studied electronic engineering at the
        University of the Basque Country — my thesis taught an NVIDIA JetBot to harvest crops with
        computer vision. Then I went deep into .NET: document protection at a cybersecurity company
        in Bilbao, then critical infrastructure for the public sector — health, justice and
        emergency services.
      </p>
      <p>
        Somewhere between a master's degree and a home server, the job title stopped fitting. Now I
        build products end to end: I write the spec, direct AI agents through the implementation,
        and ship to a self-hosting platform I built myself. Engineer by training, product builder
        by compulsion.
      </p>
      <ul class="facts">
        <li>
          <span class="fact-label">Languages</span>
          Basque &amp; Spanish (native) · English (C1) ·
          <a href="/projects/deutschmeister/">German (B1 in progress — see DeutschMeister)</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="fact-label">Day job</span>
          .NET software engineer — Blazor, ASP.NET Core, the works
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="fact-label">After hours</span>
          AI agents, my tower, and whatever the next spec says
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="about-mark" aria-hidden="true">
      <Logo size={180} />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: var(--s-12);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-mark {
    color: var(--line);
    transition: color 0.4s ease;
  }

  .about-mark:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .facts {
    list-style: none;
    margin: var(--s-6) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-3);
  }

  .fact-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-mark {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
